      "description": {
        "fun": "Furfrou is a poodle with a fashion habit: groomers can trim and dye its coat into nine styles, from Heart and Star to Kabuki and Pharaoh, and it grows back to its natural look after five days. In ancient Kalos it guarded the king, and aristocrats competed to give it the most exquisite cut, though it lets only people it trusts near it with scissors. Lumiose City even has a Furfrou-only league.",
        "guide": "Furfrou is a Normal-type poodle-like Pokémon from Kalos that once guarded the kings of the region. Its fur can be trimmed into nine different styles, which grow out after a few days. It is intelligent and loyal to its Trainer.",
        "tagline": "A royal poodle that changes its look with every trim",
